Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Let me join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to play with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm often lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Go to Shizuka's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I've got to do something. Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me when you go to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,OK. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel very happy to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I will come back to Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're always good friends even we're separate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is souvenir for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll write to you when I go to America
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do remember. So do I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,His friend moves
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I move away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll feel lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I'll move to America too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make such joke at this time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey. Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll move to America
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.78,0:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,America!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.45,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's OK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no some strange man, this place will become better
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not important
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much... That's all, in either case I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not serious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a try
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypothetic box
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's very nice to have this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.21,0:02:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I move to America...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, I'm coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yebi, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, darling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Will you move to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there your company in America either?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I have to move there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very toilsome
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Doraemon, father will move to America
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Make prepare to move quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to tell them quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, it's better to transmit that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's almost
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know whom the first one is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.91,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Nobita, will you move to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let those rogues tease you in America
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not used to live there, you may come back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really surprised! How could Suneo cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's must be Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,will you go to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered the past
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not kind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even I teased you on purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel maybe you hate me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and think I'm a boring guy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've not hated you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'm glad to hear that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This's souvenir, here you are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... I can't accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, if you don't accept it, I'll feel sad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't destroy it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You may return it to him later
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Shizuka this time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We take the place of our classmates to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hold up Nobita's farewell in the school tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Troublesome... it's too troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This... that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all, so troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,before Shizuka comes here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, will you go to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be firm there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make Japan to be shameful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't speak English, it'll be very troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you English tape
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd recite before you start out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll test you every day, see you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you play any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, get back the original state as soon as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, aren't you Shizuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Shizuka, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in please
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... will you really move to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In a word, come in first
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka, I've been waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you move to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really too sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I---
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I... because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back the original state quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.85,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, there's no ring
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really something wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops... what's the matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not repaired, I really move to America
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.59,0:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to America
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't it be repaired?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This's present
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, then I'll take it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it been repaired?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless to urge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle in Hokkaido
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to send me off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, hurry! Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:09:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so fast, this machine is very tangle some
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've not finished my talk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unnecessary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can't set my heart at rest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please follow me to come out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I often teased you before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me please! I beg you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't beat me, I won't be comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You said so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.03,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not serious, I won't be polite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.61,0:10:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's repaired
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back the original state
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, why do you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Suneo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Suneo, Shizuka Giant, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks...
